% tst_zerndef_extfringe.in -- tst_zerndef_fringe.in with ZernType= ExtFringe (PLAN_CONSOLIDATION
% 1.2, 2026-10-12).  Extended Fringe is Fringe's ordering continued past 37 (group p = (n+|m|)/2,
% |m| descending, cos before sin); on modes 1-36 the two are the same polynomials, so mode 9
% (spherical) must trace IDENTICALLY to the Fringe twin.  The converter (surfsub ZerntoMon_ZFE)
% existed but no dispatch called it, so pre-fix this deck traced as the bare conic -- the red.
% GATE: cli_tests/cmd/ZernType_extfringe.jou.
